# Simple Calculator in C (Lab 04)

A straightforward console-based calculator written in C. This program performs fundamental arithmetic operations (Addition, Subtraction, Multiplication, and Division) utilizing floating-point numbers for accurate decimal calculations. 

## 🚀 Features
* Performs mathematical operations based on user-input operators (`+`, `-`, `*`, `/`).
* Processes decimal values using `float` variables.
* Clean and interactive command-line interface.

* program uses do while loop and switch statement for continous calculation
